<</A<</BBox[-1.19698 75.8058 596.325 794.924]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>/Alt(A woman moves away from a doctor, who is waving her goodbye at the left edge of the picture, and approaches another doctor who is already waiting for her to the right with an outstretched hand. The two doctors are partially concealed by two oversized smartphones that are positioned in front of them.\rThe smartphones are connected by a heartbeat line in a sinus rhythm. \rA stylised digital network of nodes and connections can be seen in the background.␀)/K 1509/P 1457 0 R/Pg 285 0 R/S/Figure>>
